  "details": "When going to a world with LODs set up, only the instance host has functioning LODs. Everyone else will have their LOD biased heavily to the LOD0, making the LOD distance much further than intended. This can have pretty severe performance impacts on some maps.\n\nEdit: My bad, after further testing it turns out it was related to quality settings for the client when holding shift on startup. The person I was testing with and I had different quality settings.",
